bility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPCTLH62GskxuO0rAsZQUV7tR7BdyJ2EaOvj99todDAUEFvy4RghMyLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 24px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            关于 Villa Betulia 和\n            <span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;color: rgb(30, 32, 34);font-family: \"Ideal Sans SSm A\", \"Ideal Sans SSm B\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n             Luis Anibal Calderón\n            </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 24px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          路易斯先生是第二代咖农，从12岁起就跟着父亲在咖啡地头农作，15岁时，父亲给了他小块地，从此Luis每年都可以从这块地获得一些额外的收益，经过多年的奋斗，2005年Luis在Acevedo买下一块20公顷的土地，建立了Betulia庄园；2012年是Luis的一个转折点，在这之前，他一直挣扎在之前的错误投资带来的经济负担中，2012年，Luis尝试种植了5000株瑰夏，占当时总种植5%，其余的都是Castillo和Caturra，2015年，这些瑰夏开始有产出产生经济回报，由于相比传统品种和传统的商业采购，瑰夏能有更高的溢价，也使得Luis从此认定了种植稀有和高净值的品种才是一个好的出路，随后他种植了很多市面上罕见的品种，像粉波旁，条纹波旁，尖身波旁，粉红瑰夏，矮树种瑰夏，Sidra，Wushwush，Java， Papayo，玛拉瑰夏以及庄园独有的品种Primtivo（黄果皮的）。\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rdcv4XS9WJthsDunK3o1icbv6rktLgwWHzjxxp93mdse34dshQIMdiajv8ow41VSxmJicApWSE7nzbA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;text-align: center;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          Mocca\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rdcv4XS9WJthsDunK3o1icbRlnGurZf0mx25S1NOACiaCA5Jct5ASibibYwbvCkXq4XHvQzKYZStdSkw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-align: center;\">\n          Orange Gesha\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 24px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          2016年，Luis结识了Cofinet的创始人之一Felipe，这次结识就好似伯乐寻到了千里马一样，借助Cofinet成熟的销售网络和先进的处理技术资源，Luis从2016\n         </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          年\n         </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          开始连续稳定的供应它的各种稀有品种的不同处理方式的产品，2018年，Luis终于将拖欠银行近10年的贷款还清。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 24px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          现在58岁的Luis和他的妻子、三个儿子一起勤劳的作战在Betulia。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SSkjhyIC0XgrGoGdbtEoz1u0cf9xttecAjQsO2AUJOKXXPvrc2WGxoLO1Oic613WsRgsyGgPJp3tw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 24px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 24px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          <br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 431px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
